Full review comments:

- [P1] Synchronize the plan registry when reordering blocks — C:\Users\NR SMART\tools\lcdg-reel-atelier\lcdg_1105\scripts_1105.py:250-259
  This rewrites block-to-file assignments but never updates `episodes/plans_utilises.json`, which is keyed by episode and block index. After a reorder such as installations block 2 now using `B5.mp4`, later `prepare.py` or `broll.py` runs will associate the wrong source with the block, breaking duplicate-footage checks and attribution.

- [P2] Remove the unsupported 92/8 visual split — C:\Users\NR SMART\tools\lcdg-reel-atelier\lcdg_1105\scripts_1105.py:213-214
  The `calcul` insert renders each `value` proportionally, so these values visually assert that 92% of the average comes from already-installed doctors and 8% from new doctors. The sources only support that new installations may lower the average, not this ratio; use a qualitative visual or a sourced proportion instead.
